        "text": "Page: Still Loving You. Sentence: \"Still Loving You\" is a heavy metal ballad by the German rock band Scorpions.\nPage: Still Loving You. Sentence: It was released in July 1984 as the second single from their ninth studio album, \"Love at First Sting\" (1984).\nPage: Still Loving You. Sentence: The song reached number 64 on \"Billboard\" Hot 100.\nPage: Love at First Sting. Sentence: Love at First Sting is the ninth studio album by German hard rock band Scorpions.\nPage: Love at First Sting. Sentence: The album contains \"Rock You Like a Hurricane\", \"Still Loving You\", and \"Big City Nights\", three of the band's most famous songs.",
